.TH "whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah" "6" "2026-11-21" "Whisky in a Tube User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah - the command to run Whisky in a Tube.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Whisky in a Tube is a 4k intro released by Faemiyah in august 2014.
Ended 7th at Assembly 2014 combined 4k intro compo.
.PP
By default the intro starts in fullscreen at the desktop resolution,
with V-Sync enabled.
The picture keeps its aspect ratio (black bars are added when needed),
and the window can be resized.
.IP \[bu] 2
Juippi: additional code, music
.IP \[bu] 2
Trilkk: code
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
-d [ --developer ]
Developer mode.
.TP
-R [ --record ]
Do not play intro normally, instead save audio as .raw and frames as
\&.png -files in the current directory.
Use it together with -w.
.TP
-r [ --resolution ] arg
Resolution to use, specify as `WIDTHxHEIGHT', `720p' or `1080p'
(default: 1280x720).
In fullscreen, the picture is scaled to the desktop resolution.
.TP
-w [ --window ]
Start in window instead of full-screen.
.TP
-h [ --help ]
Print help text.
.SH KEYS
.TP
ESC
to quit
.TP
F
toggle fullscreen (desktop resolution)
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=63860
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
